{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45340","headline":"禅思 · 皎然","name":"禅思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真我性无主，谁爲尘识昏。\n奈何求其本，若拔大木根。\n妄以一念动，势如千波翻。\n伤哉子桑扈，虫臂徒虚言。\n神威兴外论，宗邪生异源。\n空何妨色在，妙岂废身存。\n寂灭本非寂，諠譁曾未諠。\n嗟嗟世上禅，不共智者论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}